### :param new: The value to write when it matches.
### :returns: `None` when `new` was written, the value found when not.
routine @Unbroken[T].compare_exchange_weak_release(expected: T, new: T) -> Maybe[T]
needs T: typename, UnbrokenExchangeable[T]
    return me.value.compare_exchange_weak_unbroken_release(expected, new)

### Writes `new` if the value is `expected`, unbroken and acquire and release: `None` if it did, the value found if
