### :param expected: The value expected.
### :param new: The value to write when it matches.
### :returns: `None` when `new` was written, the value found when not.
routine @Unbroken[T].compare_exchange_weak_acq_rel(expected: T, new: T) -> Maybe[T]
needs T: typename, UnbrokenExchangeable[T]
    return me.value.compare_exchange_weak_unbroken_acq_rel(expected, new)

### Adds `value` (wrapping) and returns what was there, unbroken and sequentially consistent.
